# neck/woman/kerchief: the woman's neckerchief in accent: the band at her throat, its point down to her collarbone, the knot at
# the nape with two short tails that sway behind her on the walk and stream in the run (keys hang, as her scarf)
# GARB-W (P2b wave 2). Fitted to one body (STYLE_P2 22). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person woman
body woman
role neck kerchief
layer neck
anchor neck
keys hang

